        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 3:10AM AKDT until September 26 at 4:00AM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Southeast winds 20 to 30 kt and seas 7 to 12 ft
expected.

* WHERE...Icy Cape to Cape Suckling from 15 to 80 NM.

* WHEN...Until 4 AM AKDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
